  "project_description": "The module module provides a dynamic token for the current URL. This module also allows you to extract specific URL parts and query parameters.\n\n Usage \n 1. In your View, add a field and select the Global: Current URL field.\n\n2. Choose the Path Type option to specify whether you want to use internal path if its a path alias.\n\n3. Select the Output Type option to customize how the extracted information is displayed.\n\n Similar projects \n https://www.drupal.org/project/views_current_path \n\n Back to top",
